  "content": "<h1>已封存</h1>\n<p>Cobblepedia 将不再接收任何重大更新。</p>\n<p>我决定停止此项目，以便专注于开发 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-knowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cobblemon Knowlogy 模组</strong></a>，这是一个较新的模组，同样会在游戏中添加书籍形式的百科信息，并且会定期更新以保持与 Cobblemon 同步。</p>\n<h1>Cobblepedia</h1>\n<p>一款基于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fcable-mc%252fcobblemon%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a> 的游戏中内建 Poképedia（宝可梦百科）书籍物品，使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/VazkiiMods/Patchouli/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a> 引擎，展示来自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.cobblemon.com%252findex.php%252fMain_Page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 Cobblemon Wiki</a> 的信息，并追踪由 Cobblemon 添加的进度成就。</p>\n<h2>功能特性：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>符合 Cobblemon 美学的自定义 UI 纹理（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblepedia%252fgallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看画廊</a>）</li>\n<li>进度成就</li>\n<li>合成配方</li>\n<li>基础教程</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>如何获取 Poképedia 百科书：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>完成“选择初始宝可梦”进度后获得；</li>\n<li>使用一本书和任意一种花蓓果合成；</li>\n<li>在创造模式下获得（位于工具和实用道具创意标签页中）；</li>\n<li>或使用命令：对于 mc1.20.1 使用 <code>/give @s patchouli:guide_book{\"patchouli:book\": \"cobblepedia:cobblepedia\"}</code>，对于 mc1.21.1 使用 <code>/give @p patchouli:guide_book[patchouli:book=\"cobblepedia:cobblepedia\"]</code>。（需要开启作弊/拥有 OP 权限）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>模组依赖</h2>\n<h3><em>Patchouli</em></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpatchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p>提供将 Poképedia 添加到游戏的功能。</p>\n<h3><em>Cobblemon</em></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p>提供书中解释的内容。</p>\n<h2>推荐模组</h2>\n<h3><em>Cobblemon Interface</em> 资源包</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcobblemon-interface\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cobblemon-interface\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p>更改 Minecraft 界面以更好地适应 Cobblemon 的用户界面风格。</p>\n<h3><em>PatchouliButton</em> 模组</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpatchoulibutton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchoulibutton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p>在物品栏中添加一个列出 Poképedia 的按钮。你可以修改其配置，使其直接跳转到 Cobblemon 百科书（对整合包制作者很有用）。</p>\n<h2>本地化</h2>\n<p>本模组包含以下语言的翻译文件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>巴西葡萄牙语</strong> (pt_br)，由我制作；</li>\n<li><strong>简体中文</strong> (zh_cn)，由 Gitlab 上的 <code>@x1759603258</code> 制作；</li>\n<li><strong>意大利语</strong> (it_it)，由 Discord 上的 <code>@mik_profilo_di</code> 制作；</li>\n<li><strong>西班牙语</strong> (es_es)，由 Discord 上的 <code>@lavinytuttini</code> 制作；</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>注：部分翻译可能已过时和/或不完整。</em></p>\n<h2>其他：</h2>\n<p>纹理灵感来源于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/torrezx-improved-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torrezx-Improved Library</a> 资源包的书籍，并受到 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fSbIA8FKhwl0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">传说阿尔宙斯预告片</a> 开场书中书籍设计的启发</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f934267676354834442%252f1091579923396820992\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.0/assets/compact/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> 在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 Cobblemon Discord 服务器</a>上</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblepedia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fM4M5K4BDR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>",
